    navigation

      F1 / F2         home / latest results
      F3 / F4         downloads / sources
      F5              settings
      tab / shift+tab home: focus controls; elsewhere: downloads / back
      esc             back or cancel current step
      ^d              downloads
      H               health history
      ?               this card
      ^c              quit
